OL,3,GNEWSAGran eyes festive charity glory   
OL,4,Awith techno track                      
OL,6,FA 70-year-old gran is set to release   
OL,7,Fher very own high-energy Christmas     
OL,8,Fcharity single vying to be this year's 
OL,9,Fnumber one.                            
OL,11,FMJ, from Rugby, says her festive techno
OL,12,Ftrack Christmas Day Is Coming is one to
OL,13,F"dance and rave to rather than the     
OL,14,Fmelody ones" and is "something         
OL,15,Fdifferent".                            
OL,17,F"I just thought to myself, 'I think we 
OL,18,Fneed a change', and I just started     
OL,19,Fwriting about Christmas and enjoying   
OL,20,Fourselves," said MJ, who records as    
OL,21,FChristmas Gran.                        
